          "block_type": "text",
          "heading": "DTC Logic",
          "role": "dtc_logic",
          "text": "The HV system interlock circuit monitors continuity of the service plug and high-voltage connectors.\nWhen the ECM detects an open circuit in the interlock loop, DTC P0A0D is set.\n\nConfirmation procedure:\n1. Connect the Nissan scan tool.\n2. Turn the ignition ON.\n3. Check for active DTCs.",
          "location": { "start_pdf_page": 88, "page_refs": ["EVB-88"] },
          "extraction": { "status": "success" }
